# Bouncy Castle (levels/solo/bouncy.txt): the first fling, the shelf, the lid, the chimney; then
# back into the wall cushion to fly the moat flat under the gate, the castle's three floors
# (jump into each end's cushion to be flung up a floor); then the moat: grab the four nuggets,
# Down (fired up), run the belts into a long jump over it; three even hops, Down (the waltz),
# and the trampoline's spring on ONE up the castle wall to the plunger.
wait 0.3
hold Left 0.2
hold Left Space 250ms
hold Right 0.25
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 1.3
at 2.6
hold Right Space 250ms
hold Right 0.05
hold Right Space 250ms
hold Left 0.15
hold Left Space 250ms
hold Left 0.6
at 4.3
hold Right 0.6
hold Right Space 250ms
hold Right 0.1
hold Right Space 250ms
hold Right 2.7
hold Space 0.2
wait 0ms
hold Right Space 250ms
hold Right 1.5
wait 0.2
hold Right Space 300ms
wait 0.8
hold Right 0.7
wait 0.2
hold Left 0.3
hold Right 0.5
wait 0.3
hold Right 0.4
hold Right Space 0.3
wait 0
hold Right 0.2
hold Right Space 0.3
hold Right 0.1
hold Right 2.8
hold Right Space 0.3
hold Right 0.1
hold Left 0.5
wait 0.3
hold Left 1.7
hold Left Space 0.2
hold Left 0.1
hold Right 0.5
wait 0.3
hold Right 2.2
wait 0.1
hold Right 0.6
wait 0.1
hold Right 0.6
wait 0.1
hold Right 0.6
wait 0.5
hold Right 2.2
wait 0.2
tap Down
wait 1.0
hold Left 0.9
hold Right 0.5
hold Right Space 0.35
hold Right 0.15
hold Right Space 0.3
hold Right 0.15
wait 0.4
repeat 3
hold Space 150ms
wait 0.6
end
tap Down
wait 2.5
hold Right 1.15
hold Right Space 0.3
hold Right 1.5
wait 0.5
